<li>My Favorite Mitch Murder</li>
<li>FreCher</li>
<li>Neko Casefile</li>
<li>Good (Charlotte) Hang</li>
</ul>
<p>Eh, on second thought, maybe don’t do that. Keep your music and your pods separate.</p>
<p>But do listen to either on your MEE Audio 60W PartySPKR Boombox.</p>